        "passed": true
      }
    ],
    "summary": "Restored after-only review selections and embedded exact pinned selected code in attribution and assessment. Added verified deletion markers, explicit attribution indices, and immutable historical replay. Passed 78 focused task-review regressions plus 14 final scope/compatibility checks; typecheck/build and author self-review completed. No hosted S2 re-review started.",
